ncePlayers and opponents can now make occasional inaccuracies, mistakes, and blunders based on their skill, condition, and the position.Move selection considers a wider range of engine-evaluated moves.Card combos now depend more on the board position, game phase, and opponent’s counterplan.Favorable combos provide an advantage without automatica","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:44:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033686","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:07:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022920-1840944183784470","game_id":"steam-5022920","kind":"update","title":"Quality of Life & Match Experience Update","summary":"Quality of Life & Match Experience UpdateEconomy & SavesMoney stored in the bank now earns 10% interest each week.You can choose exactly how much money to deposit.Clear hover explanations have been added for bank deposits, academy investments, and weekly expenses.Emergency funds and training costs have been adjusted to feel fairer, especially early in a career.The first three save slots now keep autosaves from your last three in-game days. The remaining slots are available for manual saves.Caree","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T19:15:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784470","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022920-1840310314352125","game_id":"steam-5022920","kind":"update","title":"Card Clarity & Match Flow Update","summary":"This update makes Chess Town Demo’s card-based chess matches clearer, smoother, and more consistent.Clearer CardsAdded category badges to every card: Attack, Defense, Tactic, Positional, Opening, and Endgame.Added play-order badges: Start, Continue, Finish, and Flexible.Rewrote card descriptions to be shorter and make each card’s role easier to understand.Improved card and badge tooltips to explain categories, order, combos, counters, and card effects.NPC card threats and suitable responses are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T17:09:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352125","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022920-1840310314343694","game_id":"steam-5022920","kind":"update","title":"Chess Town Demo – Update v1.0.5","summary":"Chess Town Demo – Update v1.0.5A new update for the Chess Town Demo is now live!This update focuses mainly on improving tutorials, clarity, and the overall new-player experience.Changes & FixesFixed an issue during the tutorial where skipping certain activities and only playing matches could cause the player to get stuck due to the time restriction.Improved the explanation of the Evaluation Bar, making it clearer what it represents and how it works during a chess match.Added clearer information ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T03:19:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314343694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5022920-1840310314338512","game_id":"steam-5022920","kind":"announcement","title":"Chess Town Demo Is Now Playable!","summary":"🎉 Chess Town Demo Is Now Playable!We’re excited to announce that the Chess Town demo is now available to play on Steam!Begin your journey as an aspiring chess player. Improve your skills, manage your time and energy, take on jobs around the city, prepare for tournaments, and take your first steps toward becoming a Grandmaster.What’s Included in the Demo?In the demo, you can experience the opening days of your chess career, explore the daily-life management systems, earn money through city jobs, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T08:06:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5022920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5022920":"2026-10-26T07:15:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5022920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:55Z"},"5034490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:56Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5022920","app_id":5022920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3a4b35c0f7c08449caf3efe3f84304e041d551862d45cdc1b92e395874f5db2f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A cozy chess career simulation where every move matters. Shape your strategy with decision cards, rise through local tournaments, and work city jobs to build the life that supports your path to becoming a champion.","publishers":[{"name":"Ludo Narrative Lab","creator_clan_account_id":46235822}],"developers":[{"name":"Ludo Narrative Lab","creator_clan_account_id":46235822}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,